---
source: crates/observed_macros_impl/tests/expansion.rs
expression: output
---
---- input ----
#[derive(Enrichment)]
enum Bad { A }

---- yields ----
Enrichment can only be derived for structs, not enums

---- input ----
#[derive(Enrichment)]
union Bad { a: i64 }

---- yields ----
Enrichment can only be derived for structs, not unions

---- input ----
#[derive(Enrichment)]
struct Bad;

---- yields ----
Enrichment can only be derived for structs with named fields

---- input ----
#[derive(Enrichment)]
struct Bad(i64);

---- yields ----
Enrichment can only be derived for structs with named fields
